1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:01,760
The team wants customers

2
00:00:01,760 --> 00:00:02,840
to reorder faster.

3
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:04,760
So they spend two months

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,930
specifying a smart

5
00:00:05,930 --> 00:00:07,300
reorder dashboard.

6
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:08,710
It launches,

7
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,340
and almost nobody opens it.

8
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:12,820
When the team finally watches

9
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,190
a few customers order,

10
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,350
they see what people really do.

11
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,400
They type in the part number

12
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,770
from an old invoice.

13
00:00:20,290 --> 00:00:22,350
So the team tries something much smaller.

14
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:25,500
A reorder button on past orders,

15
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:26,760
built in a week,

16
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:27,900
switched on for

17
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,290
a handful of customers,

18
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,630
and within days

19
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:32,150
it's clear people use it.

20
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,000
The dashboard was

21
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,350
a complicated answer

22
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:37,200
to a complex problem.

